rong&gt;=0A                                                    2. To connect a=
 wireless printer, download the latest=0A                                  =
                  driver and software package for your printer model from=
=0A                                                    the official website=
 and follow these steps:=0A                                                =
&lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;a) Sel=
ect the Start button, then select Settings &gt;=0A                            =
